y make the PC version more stable too.NewJoining screen – while you join, the game shows every step (signing in, looking for the session, connecting) until you are in the lobby. You can cancel at any time, and it ends on its own with a messag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:15:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042607","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046240-1844115010492706","game_id":"steam-5046240","kind":"announcement","title":"Map Editor Upgrades, Factory Ladder & Lobby Cleanup","summary":"Map editorMove factories by drag and drop – hold one with the select tool and pull it to its new spot. On mirrored maps the partner moves with it; Ctrl+Z takes the whole move back.A new TEMPLATE tool draws guide shapes on the ground – line, rectangle, circle, oval, triangle – that factories snap to. Guides are scaffolding only: never visible in a match, no effect on play.Factories on the board are drawn as their real buildings instead of circles.Stepping the factory class now sets the garrison t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T16:59:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492706","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046240-1843481262701061","game_id":"steam-5046240","kind":"announcement","title":"AI Overhaul - Smarter, More Strategic, No Cheating","summary":"We’ve spent the last few days focusing entirely on improving the AI - and we’ve worked some magic. We hope you enjoy it!AI Difficulty OverhaulEasy is now the default difficulty and is designed to be straightforward and fun to master.Medium goes far beyond simply attacking mindlessly. It actively tries to maximize its production, can redirect fleets when it notices you moving troops, and reacts to your actions in many more ways.Hard builds on Medium, but thinks a little faster and takes advantage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T08:41:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5046240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5046240":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5046240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z"},"5096430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:44:14Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5046240","app_id":5046240,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f00e158bc85ddddc8b111c20d98c8c3b028eada7b8e9b858554a68e2627a9641","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"결정만 남긴 실시간 전략. 보유한 공장은 모두 쉬지 않고 생산하며, 함선의 행선지는 당신이 정하고 비행 중에 돌릴 수도 있습니다. 커맨더 모드는 전쟁 경제를 더합니다: 철과 금 네트워크, 터렛, 위성, 궤도 공격. 온라인 최대 8인. 몇 시간이 아니라 몇 분.","publishers":[{"name":"GoraGames","creator_clan_account_id":41375655}],"developers":[{"name":"GoraGames","creator_clan_account_id":41375655}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_c